I definitions.inc

# pull：双方在共同祖先后把同一文件改成不同内容，merge 段冲突
# 共同起点 base
> init
<<<
+ conf.txt mbase.txt
> add conf.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<

C remote
> init
<<<
+ conf.txt mbase.txt
> add conf.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<

# 本地侧改成 current side
C
+ conf.txt mconf-c.txt
> add conf.txt
<<<
> commit "local edit"
<<<

# 远程侧改成 given side
C remote
+ conf.txt mconf-g.txt
> add conf.txt
<<<
> commit "remote edit"
<<<
C
> add-remote origin remote/.gitlet
<<<

# pull：fetch 静默，merge 段报冲突消息
> pull origin master
Encountered a merge conflict.
<<<

# 工作目录冲突文件逐字节等于手写五段
= conf.txt mexpect-both.txt

# merge commit 照常生成，消息中的被合并名为远程跟踪分支
> log
===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
Merged origin/master into master.

${ARBLINES}
<<<*
